00:45:41.710 --> 00:45:43.027
any hour of the day,

00:45:43.027 --> 00:45:44.850
any time of the day, any street I want

00:45:44.850 --> 00:45:47.600
because I finally can say

00:45:47.600 --> 00:45:51.530
that in certain fashions I embrace death.

00:45:51.530 --> 00:45:56.530
I embrace it, I'm not
afraid to die anymore.

00:45:56.600 --> 00:45:57.433
I used to.

00:45:57.433 --> 00:45:58.840
I think I'm more or less afraid

00:45:58.840 --> 00:46:00.200
of how I'm gonna die.

00:46:00.200 --> 00:46:01.033
What's gonna happen to me?

00:46:01.033 --> 00:46:01.866
Is somebody gonna shoot me

00:46:01.866 --> 00:46:03.629
or if he'll run me over?

00:46:03.629 --> 00:46:05.588
Bitch gonna set me up.

00:46:05.588 --> 00:46:07.106
Might just one grab my chest

00:46:07.106 --> 00:46:09.360
and have a heart attack, you know.

00:46:09.360 --> 00:46:10.193
I don't know.

00:46:10.193 --> 00:46:11.150
I'm not welcoming it,

00:46:11.150 --> 00:46:13.860
but I can actually honestly tell you

00:46:13.860 --> 00:46:15.721
that I embrace death.

00:46:15.721 --> 00:46:18.333
I don't feel that death is the last stop.

00:46:19.590 --> 00:46:21.423
I feel it's just another door opening.

00:46:21.423 --> 00:46:23.720
I can feel that way.

